<section class="box-exercise">
<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(OpenStax)/18:_Ethers_and_Epoxides_Thiols_and_Sulfides/18.14:_Preview_of_Carbonyl_Chemistry" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B3.7D.5C)"></span><h5 class="box-legend editable"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{3}\)</span></h5>

<p data-injected-from-nickname="18a-04-OC-P03" data-injected-from-url="https://exercises.openstax.org/api/exercises?q=nickname:18a-04-OC-P03" data-injected-from-version="4" data-is-multipart="False" data-is-vocab="false" data-question-count="1" data-tags="type:practice book:stax-orgchem context-cnxmod:c622a4cf-8921-47ff-979f-3c15ab771427" data-type="injected-exercise">Identify each of the following reactions as a nucleophilic addition, nucleophilic acyl substitution, an <i>&alpha;</i> substitution, or a carbonyl condensation:</p>

